      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是那樣，\n也就只能拜託寶可夢啦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F90A36A23FF0C000A4E5F5C3153EA80FD62DC8A175BF653EF592255663002001000020114015A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寶可夢的招式\n可以分成物理招式和特殊招式。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n從能力去看招式時，\n要是分類的標記看起來尖尖刺刺的，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那就是物理招式囉。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF653EF5922768462DB5F0F000A53EF4EE5520662107269740662DB5F0F548C72796B8A62DB5F0F300200100001BE01000A5F9E80FD529B53BB770B62DB5F0F6642FF0C000A8981662F5206985E76846A198A18770B8D774F865C165C16523A523A7684FF0C00100001BE00000A90A35C31662F7269740662DB5F0F56C93002001000020114015A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果寶可夢用格鬥屬性的物理招式\n攻擊全像傳送梯，說不定就能修好了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
